# OpenTofu working directories and transient output under tofu/. The
# dependency lock file (tofu/.terraform.lock.hcl) and the encrypted state
# file (tofu/terraform.tfstate) are intentionally NOT covered by any of
# these patterns: both are committed on purpose, see tofu/README.md.
tofu/.terraform/
tofu/crash.log
tofu/crash.*.log
tofu/*.tfplan
tofu/*.tfplan.json

# A saved plan written with "tofu plan -out=plan" has no extension, so the
# patterns above do not catch it. Saved plans are encrypted but still
# transient, and the state backup duplicates a file that is already tracked.
tofu/plan
tofu/*.tfstate.backup
